4. **Environment-based non-interactive mode** - `BIVVY_PROMPT_*` env vars enable CI automation
5. **Custom yes/no handler** - Custom terminal manipulation for keyboard shortcuts beyond dialoguer capabilities
6. **Extensive test mocking** - Mock UI supports queued responses, default responses, and inspection of prompts shown

